      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PIPE · Extract\n**Purpose**: turn one material part into text (EX-1): web page (extractor, SSRF-safe), voice/audio (speech-to-text), image (vision description), PDF (Claude reads text and scans; page limit IN-2), DOCX (extractor), table (split into row materials, IN-9).\n**Input**: job {payload.part_id}.\n**Side effects**: file to S3 + asset, part text or error (an error rejects the material with the reason, IN-7), summarization starts when the last part is ready.\n**TZ**: EX-1, IN-2, IN-7, IN-9.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e5b4705-d739-588f-a4ac-ecde814e4f30",
